By default, R uses "more" as a pager. You can see this by looking at 
/usr/lib[64]/R/etc/Renviron, specifically, the "PAGER" variable. If you 
wanted to switch to a pager that supports up-down scrolling, switch it 
to /usr/bin/less.

~tom

